      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-02-10T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Windsor Machines Limited (BSE:522029) completed the acquisition of Unitech Workholding Systems Private Limited from Manishbhai Savjibhai Pipaliya, Rohitkumar Jamanbhai Donga, Punitkumar Dhirajlal Koradia, Chetan Bachubhai Makwana and Karsan Arjan Maliya.",
      "body": "Windsor Machines Limited (BSE:522029) entered into an share purchase agreement to acquire Unitech Workholding Systems Private Limited from Manishbhai Savjibhai Pipaliya, Rohitkumar Jamanbhai Donga, Punitkumar Dhirajlal Koradia, Chetan Bachubhai Makwana and Karsan Arjan Maliya for INR 420 million on November 8, 2025. As part of consideration, cash consideration of INR 170 million is paid and the balance of INR 250 million Non Cash consideration by way of Shares swap through issuance of fully paid up 0.74 million equity shares of the Company on preferential basis at INR 338.90 per share will be paid towards common equity of Unitech Workholding Systems Private Limited. \r\n\r\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, Unitech Workholding Systems Private Limited reported total revenue of INR 152.02 mi",
